      "message": "research(browser-compute): close OBS_CB_5 with a real-engine dispose probe\n\nFour-case probe on Chrome for Testing 151 over the production native-pipe\ntransport: disposing a disposeOnDetach context after its last target closed\nSUCCEEDS (the hypothesized closeContext orphan mode is falsified); double\ndispose fails with cdp_error:-32000 (dispose is not idempotent, confirming\nthat dead-incarnation CLOSING rows must reconcile to RETIRED without\nreplaying the engine call — exactly what this slice does); creating a target\nin a disposed context id fails cleanly.",
